WEBVTT

NOTE Scene captions for the silent demo recording, timed from docs/demo/recording_runbook.md in hql7-luo/foreign-trade-enterprise-rag. Fictional Northstar data.

1
00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Login screen. Credentials are entered off camera.

2
00:07.000 --> 00:13.000
The employee workspace: Northstar's internal Knowledge Desk.

3
00:13.000 --> 00:29.000
Asked about NSTR-VESSEL-731, the assistant answers steel, 500 ml and MOQ 144 units, each with a source.

4
00:29.000 --> 00:43.000
Opening a citation shows the catalog file, row, SKU and a short excerpt.

5
00:43.000 --> 00:58.000
The lantern's current lead time is not in the approved data, so the answer says it is unverified.

6
00:58.000 --> 01:15.000
Historical payment terms and Incoterms are shown as dated records, not as current policy.

7
01:15.000 --> 01:25.000
The admin stages a proposed update from a synthetic CSV. It becomes a review item, not a fact.

8
01:25.000 --> 01:39.000
The reviewer compares 144 and 180 units with their sources and adds a note.

9
01:39.000 --> 01:48.000
The change is approved.

10
01:48.000 --> 02:03.000
Product Master history: 180 is now approved, and 144 is kept as the prior value.

11
02:03.000 --> 02:09.000
The admin refreshes the search index, and the job completes.

12
02:09.000 --> 02:24.000
Asked again, the assistant now answers 180 units.

13
02:24.000 --> 02:35.620
The citation points to the approved change, and its excerpt shows the same 180.
